# Hardcore Light: the light-mode counterpart of Ghostty's Hardcore, made for
# tim.waldin.net (no light theme in the Ghostty library is close to it).
#
# Background, foreground, cursor, selection and the neutral slots (0, 7, 8, 15)
# keep Hardcore's contrast ratio against the background, measured from the
# light end instead of the dark end: #121212 becomes #f2f2f2, the grey text
# stays 7.2:1, colour 0 stays next to the background, colour 15 stays the
# strongest text. Output written for Hardcore therefore reads the same way.
# Accents keep Hardcore's OKLCH hue and chroma; only lightness changes, so
# normal colours sit at 4.5:1 and bright colours at 5.5:1 (bright stays the
# stronger variant). Where Hardcore reuses a colour (blue and magenta), the
# bright slot matches the normal one here too.

